---
import CollectDeskLayout from "@/layouts/CollectDeskLayout.astro";
---
<CollectDeskLayout title="内容分类 · 影视采集站信号台" page="category">
	<header class="mast" id="hdr"></header>
	<div class="ticker" id="tick"></div>

	<div class="container hero" style="border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:14px">
		<div class="hero-kicker">Category Index — 按内容分类浏览</div>
		<h1>想看什么内容，<br>从<span class="hl">分类</span>里挑信号。</h1>
		<p class="sub">分类来自各接口公开的 class 元数据。点分类标签直达对应分组，每组内按 30 日均速排序。</p>
	</div>

	<div class="container">
		<div class="cat-sum"><span class="k mono">分类覆盖</span><span class="v serif" id="catSum">—</span></div>
	</div>

	<div class="container" style="padding-bottom:70px">
		<div class="toolbar">
			<div class="search"><input id="catQ" placeholder="筛选分类名，如：动漫 / 短剧 / 韩国剧…" /></div>
		</div>
		<div class="cat-index" id="catIndex"></div>
		<div id="catList"></div>
	</div>

	<footer class="site-foot" id="ftr"></footer>
</CollectDeskLayout>
